# Qacey development account

Work in fresh development clones under this account's projects directory.
Create linked worktrees from those clones. Treat the operator's projects,
deployment paths, production services and credentials as outside this workspace.

Follow the repository's AGENTS.md and the owner's selected Superpowers and
Gstack workflows. Install selected native skills only when the owner requests
them. Keep one installation owner for each skill.

Run project edits, tests, builds and dependency downloads in the workspace
sandbox. For an action requiring administrator privileges, give the owner the
exact command and its purpose to run in their sudo-authorized SSH terminal.
Keep passwords and authentication tokens out of agent input.
